.TH VIBEOS-CLOCK 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-clock \- clock for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-clock
.RB [ \-\-ringing ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS DeskClock rebuilt in GTK 4: alarms, world clocks, timers, the stopwatch and the screen saver. It is D-Bus activatable as vibeos.Clock. With \-\-ringing it shows the full-screen ringing alarm and the expired timers, as the alarm service starts it.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-clock-alarms(1)
